{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"uv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/fit_residual.py');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('from research_model import shape_at', '''from research_model import shape_at\nfrom scipy.signal import lfilter\n\ndef finite_ewma(x,half,n=10080):\n values=x.to_numpy(dtype=float);ok=np.isfinite(values);lam=2**(-1/half)\n num=lfilter([1.],[1.,-lam],np.where(ok,values,0.));den=lfilter([1.],[1.,-lam],ok.astype(float))\n if len(x)>n:\n  num[n:]-=lam**n*num[:-n].copy();den[n:]-=lam**n*den[:-n].copy()\n return pd.Series(num/np.maximum(den,1e-12),index=x.index)\n''')\ns=s.replace(\\\"var.ewm(halflife=h,min_periods=60,adjust=True).mean()\\\", \\\"finite_ewma(var,h)\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"rangevar=(np.log(df.high.astype(float)/df.low.astype(float))**2/(4*np.log(2))/season).ewm(halflife=60,min_periods=60).mean()\\\", \\\"rangevar=finite_ewma(np.log(df.high.astype(float)/df.low.astype(float))**2/(4*np.log(2))/season,60)\\\")\ns=s.replace('volume.ewm(halflife=60).mean()', 'finite_ewma(volume,60)').replace('volume.ewm(halflife=1440).mean()', 'finite_ewma(volume,1440)').replace('trades.ewm(halflife=60).mean()', 'finite_ewma(trades,60)').replace('trades.ewm(halflife=1440).mean()', 'finite_ewma(trades,1440)')\ns=s.replace(\\\".iloc[::-1].shift(-1)\\\", \\\".iloc[::-1].shift(-3)\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 7 preliminary diagnostic: range/volume/all features reduce August proxy MSE, with rough log-width-based potential around 0.17%/0.26%/0.44% CRPS; leverage alone worsens the proxy. Memory ratios alone explain approximately 0.26%, so the incremental all-feature opportunity is smaller, approximately 0.18%. Before official testing, discovered training EWMA used unlimited history while serving only sees seven days. Fix the diagnostic training to exact finite-seven-day weighted moments and shift future targets to reflect the one-hour prompt's issuance lead. The first diagnostic is provisional and superseded on rerun. Serving correction will omit the fitted intercept because a global 15% narrowing already failed; test only conditional residual variation.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
