{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"agent_message","text":"The broader stress tests strengthen the volatility-mixture result: it improved every affected commodity/equity and one-hour crypto comparison, with larger gains around weekends.\n\nThat also raises a new calibration question. The seasonal table’s fixed shrinkage may leave quiet periods too wide. I’ll test less shrinkage separately from a stronger volatility mixture, so we can tell which change helps."}}
