{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"agent_message","text":"The older-prompt evaluation path passed its parity check: it reproduced every existing CRPS value exactly for BTC at both horizons and sparse AAPLX. Historical tests can now use that mode without changing the scorer.\n\nThe learned residual corrections remain inconsistent across windows, so I’m not selecting them. Chronos has shown modest one-hour gains so far; its second-window results are still pending."}}
