{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_78","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > agent/candidate_v2.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Candidate v1 plus a 15-minute fast EWMA for one-hour forecasts.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport os\nimport numpy as np\nfrom research_model import simulate_config\nCRYPTO={'BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE'}\ndef simulate(asset,start_time,time_increment=300,time_length=86400,num_simulations=1000,context_prices=None):\n    seed=int(os.environ.get('SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED','20261011'));short=time_length<=3600\n    config={'seasonal':True,'clock':True,'events':True,'event_bar_alignment':short,\n            'mix':.35 if short or asset not in CRYPTO else 0.,\n            'fast_half':15 if short else 720,\n            '_calendar_path':os.environ.get('SYNTH_BENCHMARK_CALENDAR',''),'_seed':seed}\n    return simulate_config(asset,start_time,time_increment,time_length,num_simulations,context_prices,np.random.default_rng(seed),config)\nPY\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 14 initial result: 15-minute fast EWMA improves 9/10 crypto1h cells, mean -0.1803%/-0.2378%; 240-minute EWMA worsens 9/10, +0.0882%/+0.6986%. Verdict: KEEP fast15 for combined validation, DISCARD fast240. This simple causal change is more consistent than the fitted residual layer. Candidate v2 changes only the one-hour fast half-life relative to candidate v1; test its incremental benefit on the same two full ten-day windows.\n\nIteration 6 multi-seed result: on BTC/SOL/AAPLX/SP500 across three seeds and two windows, Sobol mean change is -0.0700% com/equ24h, -0.0164% crypto24h, but +0.0235% crypto1h. Results vary by seed, and crypto24h reverses at seed37. Verdict: do not promote a universal Sobol sampler. Test marginal stratification separately: it exactly balances each base-step Gaussian marginal at N=1000, unlike truncating a 1024-point Sobol net. Retain the original sampling pre-registered multi-seed requirement for any promotion.\nEOF\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag candidate_v2_full --model candidate_v2 --days 10 --ends 2026-09-19 2026-10-11 --formats 1h --assets BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE --workers 2 > agent/results/candidate_v2_full_suite.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
