{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"uv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/run_suite.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();\\\", \\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();p.add_argument('--research',action='store_true');\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"if fmt=='1h':cmd+=\\\", \\\"if a.research:cmd[2:2]=['--group','research']\\\\n if fmt=='1h':cmd+=\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 9 infrastructure: Chronos weights downloaded (33.6 MB) and offline inference validated on the T4. The default PyTorch native-JIT attention override failed because no C compiler is installed; disabling optional native-JIT overrides uses precompiled CUDA operators. Measured load 0.57s, first forecast 1.18s, warmed forecast 0.34s, peak allocated GPU memory 0.095 GB for 32 samples × 25 hours. Set per-process GPU memory cap to 20%. Forecasts cache complete hourly histories keyed by asset, origin, seed, and input values; all market input comes from the supplied seven-day frame. This is latency evidence only, not CRPS evidence.\nEOF\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag chronos --model research_model --research --workers 1 --assets BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE XAU SP500 --config '{\\\"seasonal\\\":true,\\\"chronos\\\":true}' > agent/results/chronos_suite.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_84","type":"agent_message","text":"The combined candidate passed both ten-day windows: it improved all 36 asset/format/window comparisons against the starter. Average per-asset reductions were about **2–3% for crypto 24-hour**, **9–12% for commodities/equities**, and **4–7% for crypto one-hour**.\n\nI’m making it the provisional serving model. Research continues with the faster one-hour volatility estimate and the remaining calibration tests; no final nomination yet."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_85","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"uv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/modeling.py');Path('agent/seasonal_checkpoint.py').write_text(p.read_text())\ns=Path('agent/research_model.py').read_text()\ns=s.replace(\\\"config=json.loads(os.environ.get('MODEL_CONFIG','{}'))\\\", \\\"config={'seasonal':True,'clock':True,'events':True,\\\\n            'event_bar_alignment':time_length<=3600,\\\\n            'mix':.35 if time_length<=3600 or asset not in {'BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE'} else 0.}\\\")\ns=s.replace('Research simulator: seasonal EWMA variance with configurable innovation laws.', 'Provisional serving candidate v1: seasonal EWMA with clock, events and volatility mixtures.')\ns=s.replace('Configurations are recorded with experiments; modeling.py will freeze the selected choices.', 'Serving choices are fixed inside simulate; MODEL_CONFIG does not affect this module.')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 12 completed: candidate_v1_full improves all 36 asset/format/window cells at 1000 paths. Equal-asset CRPS means, starter→v1:\n- Sep09–18: crypto24h 4296.6726→4217.6681; com/equ24h 2316.0261→2101.4462; crypto1h 960.4265→927.0646.\n- Oct01–10: crypto24h 3531.2042→3426.4855; com/equ24h 2065.4112→1818.4707; crypto1h 741.2317→691.7005.\nMean per-asset percentage reductions: September 2.0006%,8.7439%,3.7744%; October 3.0694%,11.8400%,6.9060%. Every configuration's daily mean improves on all 20 scored days, but some asset-days regress (notably HYPE1h Sep17, approximately +14%). Verdict: KEEP and promote to provisional modeling.py; preserve seasonal_checkpoint.py. No CHAMPION yet: faster memory, historical checks, calibration and sampling work remain worthwhile within the envelope.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nimport sys,os,numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom pathlib import Path\nsys.path.insert(0,'agent')\nfrom synth_lib.benchmark.generate_predictions import load_simulate,load_minute_prices,context_end\nimport candidate_v1\nfn=load_simulate(Path('agent/modeling.py'));t=pd.Timestamp('2026-10-10',tz='UTC');os.environ['SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED']='123'\nfor asset,h,s in [('BTC',3600,60),('BTC',86400,300),('AAPLX',86400,300)]:\n frame=load_minute_prices(Path('market_data'),asset,t-pd.Timedelta(days=7),t).loc[:context_end(t,h)]\n a=np.asarray(fn(asset,str(t),s,h,17,frame)[2:]);b=np.asarray(candidate_v1.simulate(asset,str(t),s,h,17,frame)[2:]);assert np.array_equal(a,b)\n print(asset,h,'exact provisional/candidate-v1 parity',a.shape)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
