{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_112","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"uv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/predict.py');s=p.read_text().replace('    num_simulations: int = 1000,\\\\n) -> int:', '    num_simulations: int = 1000,\\\\n    prediction_dtype: str = \\\"float64\\\",\\\\n) -> int:').replace('dtype=np.float64))','dtype=np.dtype(prediction_dtype)))').replace('    ap.add_argument(\\\"--asset\\\", default=\\\"BTC\\\")','    ap.add_argument(\\\"--asset\\\", default=\\\"BTC\\\")\\\\n    ap.add_argument(\\\"--prediction-dtype\\\",choices=[\\\"float32\\\",\\\"float64\\\"],default=\\\"float64\\\")').replace('            num_simulations=args.num_simulations,','            num_simulations=args.num_simulations,\\\\n            prediction_dtype=args.prediction_dtype,');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('agent/run_suite.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();\\\",\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();p.add_argument('--prediction-dtype',choices=['float32','float64'],default='float64');\\\").replace(\\\"'--latest-formula','--output',str(prefix)]\\\",\\\"'--latest-formula','--output',str(prefix),'--prediction-dtype',a.prediction_dtype]\\\");p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nChronos cold/warm test passed exactly (maximum output difference 0.0 after clearing forecast cache). Added explicit prediction-dtype option to evaluator/suite; default stays float64 for continuity, canonical float32 will be a separately named matched experiment.\n\n## Iteration 18 — filtered empirical innovations (diagnostic)\n\nHypothesis: standardized observed returns retain tails and central concentration beyond Gaussian increments, potentially improving the one-hour realized-volatility distribution. Before implementing bootstrap, measure June–August returns divided by a strictly lagged seasonal EWMA scale: kurtosis, tail probabilities, and central absolute quantiles. Compare minute and five-minute samples. These diagnostics are not CRPS and cannot promote an innovation model. If excess tails survive filtering, test symmetric empirical resampling with unit variance; preserve zero drift, same volatility forecast and official 1000-path scoring. Reject if gains fail either window; do not assume a large kurtosis implies useful CRPS improvement.\nEOF\ncat > agent/diagnose_innovations.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Causal standardized-return diagnostics; no surrogate CRPS.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.config import default_store_root\nfrom research_model import shape_at\nout={}\nfor asset in ['BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','XAU','NVDAX','GOOGLX','TSLAX','AAPLX','WTIOIL','SPCX','SP500']:\n files=[p for p in sorted(default_store_root(asset).glob('date=*.parquet')) if '2026-06-01'<=p.stem[5:]<'2026-09-01']\n d=pd.concat([pd.read_parquet(p,columns=['timestamp','close']) for p in files]).set_index('timestamp').sort_index()\n shape=shape_at(d.index,asset,True);out[asset]={}\n for lag in [1,5]:\n  r=np.log(d.close).diff(lag)/np.sqrt(shape*lag)\n  v=.6*r.pow(2).ewm(halflife=60).mean().shift(lag)+.4*r.pow(2).ewm(halflife=4320).mean().shift(lag)\n  z=(r/np.sqrt(v)).iloc[10080:].dropna().to_numpy();z=z[np.isfinite(z)]\n  z/=np.sqrt(np.mean(z*z))\n  out[asset][lag]={'n':len(z),'kurtosis':float(np.mean(z**4)),'tail3':float(np.mean(np.abs(z)>3)), 'abs_quantiles':np.quantile(np.abs(z),[.5,.9,.99]).tolist()}\n print(asset,out[asset],flush=True)\nPath('agent/results/innovation_diagnostics.json').write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2))\nPY\nuv run agent/diagnose_innovations.py > agent/results/innovation_diagnostics.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
