{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_114","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 13 historical result: July/August seasonal model trained through July1 improves 33/36 asset-window cells; all six configuration means improve. Mean per-asset reductions for windows ending Aug01/Aug15: crypto24h 0.2078%/1.0166%, com/equ 1.8790%/8.0644%, crypto1h 1.6288%/1.4224%. These historical checks corroborate the central seasonal effect with an earlier, causally trained artifact, without field ranks.\n\nIteration 18 diagnostic reveals strong residual tails (e.g. XAU minute kurtosis32, >3-sigma probability1.49%; Gaussian benchmarks3 and0.27%). Build symmetric per-asset innovation quantiles from June–August standardized returns, cap absolute standardized shocks at8 before quantization to limit unstable extreme samples, then normalize the finite quantile grid to unit variance. Evaluate empirical innovations alone against the matched seasonal Gaussian; do not combine with path mixtures until this isolated test passes. Quantile clipping and fitting choices are fixed before CRPS results.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/diagnose_innovations.py');s=p.read_text().replace('out={}','out={};quantiles={}').replace('shape=shape_at(d.index,asset,True);out[asset]={}', 'shape=shape_at(d.index,asset,True);out[asset]={};quantiles[asset]={}').replace(' print(asset,out[asset],flush=True)', '''  q=np.quantile(np.minimum(np.abs(z),8),(np.arange(2048)+.5)/2048)\n  q/=np.sqrt(np.mean(q*q));quantiles[asset][lag]=q.tolist()\n print(asset,out[asset],flush=True)''');s+='\\\\nPath(\\\"agent/innovations.json\\\").write_text(json.dumps({\\\"training_end\\\":\\\"2026-09-01\\\",\\\"assets\\\":quantiles}))\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"    df=c.get('df',0)\\\",\\\"\\\"\\\"    if c.get('empirical',False):\n        from scipy.special import ndtr\n        quantiles=np.asarray(table('innovations.json')[asset][str(lag)])\n        u=2*np.abs(ndtr(z)-.5)\n        z=np.sign(z)*np.interp(u,(np.arange(len(quantiles))+.5)/len(quantiles),quantiles)\n    df=c.get('df',0)\\\"\\\"\\\");p.write_text(s)\nPY\nuv run agent/diagnose_innovations.py > agent/results/innovation_diagnostics.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
