{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_140","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nCandidate v3 construction check initially caught a failed text replacement (shrink/refresh keys absent). Fixed before scoring or promotion; exact equality now holds against the measured group-specific ablations for BTC both horizons and sparse AAPLX in both September and October. No score was attributed to the broken draft.\n\n## Iteration 22 — simple control for pretrained volatility gains\n\nHypothesis: Chronos's small gain could come from incorporating recent hourly variance rather than pretrained dynamics. Add a persistence control using exactly the same complete-hour deseasonalized variance series, same quarter blend and same ratio clipping, but forecast the last complete hour's variance at every future hour. Compare against fast15 and Chronos_fast15 at1000 paths, five crypto assets, both initial windows. This control needs no GPU. Keep the model only if it adds value beyond the simpler control; judge official CRPS, not training narrative.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/chronos_vol.py');s=p.read_text().replace('def forecast_variance(frame,asset,future,seed):','def forecast_variance(frame,asset,future,seed,persistence=False):').replace(\\\"    origin=hourly.index[-1]+pd.Timedelta(hours=1)\\\",\\\"    if persistence:return np.full(len(future),float(hourly.dropna().iloc[-1]))\\\\n    origin=hourly.index[-1]+pd.Timedelta(hours=1)\\\");p.write_text(s)\np=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"    if c.get('chronos',False):\\\", \\\"    if c.get('chronos',False) or c.get('hourly_persistence',False):\\\").replace(\\\"learned=forecast_variance(context_prices,asset,future,c['_seed'])\\\", \\\"learned=forecast_variance(context_prices,asset,future,c['_seed'],c.get('hourly_persistence',False))\\\");p.write_text(s)\nPY\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag hourly_persistence --model research_model --config '{\\\"seasonal\\\":true,\\\"fast_half\\\":15,\\\"hourly_persistence\\\":true}' --formats 1h --assets BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE --workers 2 > agent/results/hourly_persistence_suite.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
