{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_195","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration26 completed: six-hour hourly EWMA improves September4/5 cells (-0.0427%) but loses every October cell (+0.1983%). DISCARD smoothed hourly control. Chronos retains an incremental advantage over both simple controls tested, subject to ongoing full combined validation.\n\n## Iteration27 — attribute one-hour gains using official components\n\nHypothesis: the path-mixture improvement is concentrated in the one-hour volatility score, whereas empirical or time-varying innovations can worsen it despite more realistic individual returns. Retain the official scorer's already-computed detailed return values through a pass-through recorder inside the cached backtester path; do not reproduce or alter any scoring formula. Record interval totals, especially Vol and Overall, in prompt parquet. Gate the new diagnostics on exact total-score parity with a completed normal run.\n\nThen measure seasonal Gaussian, mixture0.35 and mean-reverting mixture on BTC/SOL across both initial windows. All use1000 paths and the official backtester worker. This is component attribution of known total scores, not an independent experiment or extra evidence of generalization. Abort the diagnostic if any total score changes.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/run_suite.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();\\\",\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();p.add_argument('--score-details',action='store_true');\\\").replace(\\\" if a.cached_prompts:cmd+=['--cached-prompts']\\\", \\\" if a.cached_prompts:cmd+=['--cached-prompts']\\\\n if a.score_details:cmd+=['--score-details']\\\");p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > agent/verify_score_details.py <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd,numpy as np\nnew=Path('agent/results/score_seasonal/BTC_1h_2026-09-16.parquet');base=Path('agent/results/seasonal')/new.name\nx=pd.read_parquet(new);y=pd.read_parquet(base);keys=['asset','time_length','start_time','scored_time']\nd=x.merge(y,on=keys,suffixes=('_new','_base'),validate='one_to_one')\nassert len(d)==len(x)==len(y)\nassert np.array_equal(d.crps_new,d.crps_base)\nassert all(json.loads(r.component_crps)['Overall']==r.crps for r in x.itertuples())\nprint('Official component recorder parity: exact on',len(d),'prompts')\nPY\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\njobs=[{'cmd':['uv','run','agent/predict.py','--asset','BTC','--model','research_model','--days','2','--eval-end','2026-09-16','--latest-formula','--cached-prompts','--score-details','--time-length','3600','--time-increment','60','--output','agent/results/score_seasonal/BTC_1h_2026-09-16'],'env':{'MODEL_CONFIG':json.dumps({'seasonal':True})},'log':'agent/results/score_details_pilot.log'}, {'cmd':['uv','run','agent/verify_score_details.py'],'log':'agent/results/score_details_parity.log'}]\nfor tag,config in [('score_seasonal',{'seasonal':True}),('score_mixture',{'seasonal':True,'mix':.35}),('score_reversion',{'seasonal':True,'mix':.35,'mix_revert':True})]:\n jobs.append({'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model','research_model','--config',json.dumps(config),'--cached-prompts','--score-details','--assets','BTC','SOL','--formats','1h','--workers','2'],'log':f'agent/results/{tag}_suite.log'})\nPath('agent/queue_score_details.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2))\nPY\nuv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_score_details.json > agent/results/queue_score_details.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
