{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_214","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration24 COM stress result: reverting latent volatility improves22/24 cells and all three means (0.0341%,0.0221%,0.1260%). KEEP as a COM-only candidate for full incremental testing; it remains rejected for1h. Add the same quarter-horizon reversion to candidate_v5, compare at float32 on both full COM windows, and preserve all other parameters. This measures whether the smaller effect survives robust variance and refreshed seasonality rather than assuming additivity.\n\nIteration23 seed11 completed: v3 improves all36 asset/window cells. Mean per-asset reductions September crypto24h1.8006%,COM7.7518%,crypto1h2.2017%; October1.1731%,5.6253%,3.0204%. Seed37 is still running. These reused-market seed checks corroborate that the main gains are not one random fan's luck.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/candidate_v5.py');s=p.read_text();needle=\\\"'_seed':seed}\\\";assert s.count(needle)==1;s=s.replace(needle,\\\"'_seed':seed,**__import__('json').loads(os.environ.get('MODEL_CONFIG','{}'))}\\\")\nPath('agent/candidate_v5_research.py').write_text(s.replace('Candidate v4 plus robust variance estimation for commodity/equity forecasts.','Research-only configurable ablation of candidate v5.'))\nPY\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag reversion_v5_float32 --model candidate_v5_research --config '{\\\"mix_revert\\\":true}' --prediction-dtype float32 --days 10 --ends 2026-09-19 2026-10-11 --assets XAU NVDAX GOOGLX TSLAX AAPLX WTIOIL SPCX SP500 --formats 24h --workers 2 > agent/results/reversion_v5_float32_suite.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
