the registered1.05 comparison finishes. This local result differs from the earlier failed0.85 test and must not be generalized into an unbounded narrowing sweep.\n\nValidate0.95 on an additional eight-day period, scoredSep23–30 (eval-endOct01), entirely after the September22 formula change and outside both original ten-day comparison windows. Use latest scoring,1000 paths,float32,all assets, and compare seeded starter,v5 andv5×0.95. All selected artifacts are available before each prompt; the October1 profile cannot be selected by pre-October context. These are additional retrospective dates, not an untouched formal holdout after the campaign's broad fitting/model selection. Reject a global scale if this window materially reverses a configuration's gain. Allocate four CPU workers within the14-worker total.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\ns=Path('agent/candidate_v6.py').read_text();needle=\\\"'robust':.5 if asset not in CRYPTO else 0.,\\\";assert s.count(needle)==1;s=s.replace(needle,needle+\\\"\\\\n            'sampler':'sobol' if asset not in CRYPTO else 'random',\\\")\nPath('agent/candidate_v7.py').write_text(s.replace('Candidate v5 plus finer commodity/equity profiles and causal refreshes.','Candidate v6 plus validated commodity/equity Sobol sampling.'))\njobs=[]\nfor tag,model,config in [('sep_late_baseline','baseline',{}),('sep_late_v5','candidate_v5',{}),('sep_late_scale95','candidate_v5_research',{'scale':.95})]:\n jobs.append({'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model',model,'--config',json.dumps(config),'--prediction-dtype','float32','--days','8','--ends','2026-10-01','--workers','4'],'log':f'agent/results/{tag}_suite.log'})\nPath('agent/queue_sep_late.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2))\nPY\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag candidate_v7_float32 --model candidate_v7 --prediction-dtype float32 --days 10 --ends 2026-09-19 2026-10-11 --assets XAU NVDAX GOOGLX TSLAX AAPLX WTIOIL SPCX SP500 --formats