4h_2026-10-01.log\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/SPCX_24h_2026-10-01.parquet\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/TSLAX_24h_2026-10-01.json\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/TSLAX_24h_2026-10-01.log\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/TSLAX_24h_2026-10-01.parquet\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/WTIOIL_24h_2026-10-01.json\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/WTIOIL_24h_2026-10-01.log\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/WTIOIL_24h_2026-10-01.parquet\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/XAU_24h_2026-10-01.json\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/XAU_24h_2026-10-01.parquet\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/XRP_1h_2026-10-01.json\n?? agent/results/sep_late_baseline/XRP_1h_2026-10-01.parquet\n?? agent/results/sep_late_scale95/\n?? agent/results/sep_late_scale95_suite.log\n?? agent/results/sep_late_v5/\n?? agent/results/sep_late_v5_suite.log\n  38939      52       11:17 /bin/bash -c uv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_sep_late.json > agent/results/queue_sep_late.log 2>&1\n  38940   38939       11:17 uv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_sep_late.json\n  38943   38940       11:17 /workspace/.venv/bin/python agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_sep_late.json\n  44225   38943       01:59 uv run agent/run_suite.py --tag sep_late_scale95 --model candidate_v5_research --config {\"scale\": 0.95} --prediction-dtype float32 --days 8 --ends 2026-10-01 --workers 4\n  44228   44225       01:59 /workspace/.venv/bin/python agent/run_suite.py --tag sep_late_scale95 --model candidate_v5_research --config {\"scale\": 0.95} --prediction-dtype float32 --days 8 --ends 2026-10-01 --workers 4\n  44283   44228       01:36 uv run agent/predict.py --asset SOL --model candidate_v5_research --days 8 --eval-end 2026-10-01 --num-simulations 1000 --latest-formula --output agent/results/sep_late_scale95/SOL_1h_2026-10-01 --prediction-dtype float32 --time-length 3600 --time-increment 60\n  44286   44283       01:36 /workspace/.venv/bin/python agent/predict.py --asset SOL --model candidate_v5_research --days 8 --eval-end 2026-10-01 --num-simulations 1000 --latest-formula --output agent/results/sep_late_scale95/SOL_1h_2026-10-01 --prediction-dtype float32 --time-length 3600 --time-increment 60\n  44302      52       01:31 /bin/bash -c cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'  ## Iteration40 — quiet-session floor in the refined COM model  Hypothesis: the earlier low-shrinkage COM experiment mixed large weekend gains with weekday losses. The now-validated fine profiles, robust level estimator and Sobol sampler may change that tradeoff, and a weekend-only floor adjustment may isolate it. On v7, test two predeclared settings: global2% shrinkage, and10% weekday/2% weekend shrinkage. Compare both against the existing10%/10% control on the full September/October windows at1000 paths,float32. Do not change scale or any other parameter.  Require gains in both configuration means and mostly favorable asset cells before considering either; report weekday/weekend daily effects, and validate any retained setting on the added late-September period before final use. No additional shrinkage grid will be inferred from the favorable stress result. Table lookup accepts a two-row shrinkage vector for this experiment, with exact old-scalar parity checked first. Queue behind the existing v7 COM workers. EOF uv run python - <<'PY' from pathlib import Path p=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text();old='''    if shrink!=.1 and arr.shape[0]==2:         raw=np.maximum((arr-.1)/.9,1e-5)         arr=(1-shrink)*raw+shrink''';new='''    strength=np.asarray(shrink,dtype=float)     if strength.ndim:strength=strength.reshape(2,1)     if arr.shape[0]==2 and np.any(strength!=.1):         raw=np.maximum((arr-.1)/.9,1e-5)         arr=(1-strength)*raw+strength''';assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s) PY uv run python - <<'PY' import sys,numpy as np,pandas as pd,json from pathlib import Path sys.path.insert(0,'agent') import modeling,research_model idx=pd.date_range('2026-09-01',periods=10080,freq='min',tz='UTC') for asset in ['BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','XAU','NVDAX','GOOGLX','TSLAX','AAPLX','WTIOIL','SPCX','SP500']:  for name in ['seasonality.json','seasonality_fine.json']:   for shrink in [.1,.02]:assert np.array_equal(modeling.shape_at(idx,asset,True,name,shrink),research_model.shape_at(idx,asset,True,name,shrink)) print('Scalar shrinkage unchanged exactly on52 asset/table/strength combinations') jobs=[] for tag,strength in [('floor02_v7_float32',.02),('weekend_floor_v7_float32',[.1,.02])]:  jobs.append({'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model','candidate_v7_research','--config',json.dumps({'seasonal_shrink':strength}),'--prediction-dtype','float32','--days','10','--ends','2026-09-19','2026-10-11','--assets','XAU','NVDAX','GOOGLX','TSLAX','AAPLX','WTIOIL','SPCX','SP500','--formats','24h','--workers','2'],'log':f'agent/results/{tag}_suite.log'}) Path('agent/queue_quiet_floor.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2)) PY uv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_quiet_floor.json --after-pid 38894 > agent/results/queue_quiet_floor.log 2>&1\n  44328   44302       01:30 uv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_quiet_floor.json --after-pid 38894\n  44331   44328       01:30 /workspace/.venv/bin/python agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_quiet_floor.json --after-pid 38894\n  44332   44331       01:30 uv run agent/run_suite.py --tag floor02_v7_float32 --model candidate_v7_research --config {\"seasonal_shrink\": 0.02} --prediction-dtype float32 --days 10 --ends 2026-09-19 2026-10-11 --assets XAU NVDAX GOOGLX TSLAX AAPLX WTIOIL SPCX SP500 --formats 24h --workers 2\n  44335   44332       01:29 /workspace/.venv/bin/python agent/run_suite.py --tag floor02_v7_float32 --model candidate_v7_research --config {\"seasonal_shrink\": 0.02} --prediction-dtype float32 --days 10 --ends 2026-09-19 2026-10-11 --assets XAU NVDAX GOOGLX TSLAX AAPLX WTIOIL SPCX SP500 --formats 24h --worke