   2026-09-19  2026-10-11\nasset fmt                        \nBTC   1h        -0.13       -0.16\nETH   1h        -0.18       -0.29\nHYPE  1h        -0.38         NaN\nSOL   1h        -0.07         NaN\nXRP   1h        -0.12         NaN\n# BUDGET — maintained by the harness (read-only for you)\n\n- Credits: 48.30 / 100.00 USD (48%)\n- Time   : 2.5 h elapsed, 15.5 h remaining (14%)\n- Phase  : normal\n\n## Harness notes\n\n- GPU: 40 min busy so far, peak memory 0.5 GiB\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_374","type":"agent_message","text":"The full-window bridge test improved all ten one-hour comparisons. Five-percent narrowing failed the added-period check when combined with the adaptive mixture, so I’m rejecting that combination. I’m preparing a verified forecast cache for later Chronos experiments, since their unchanged hourly forecasts can be reused without repeating inference."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_375","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration52 bridge-alone full result: all10 cells improve, means0.1625%/0.1058%, CRPS923.5471/690.6868. KEEP pending added-period and adaptive interaction. Iteration54 adaptive+0.95 reverses on added dates: mean+0.0241%, only2/5 cells improve, CRPS922.7662→923.0809. DISCARD that width interaction; keep scale1 for the adaptive one-hour distribution despite its favorable full-window means.\n\n## Iteration56 — verified research forecast reuse\n\nRepeated Chronos combinations use identical hourly inputs and seeds. Add an opt-in research disk cache keyed by the complete input values, asset, origin, seed, model provenance and forecasting-module source hash. Cache only the25-hour forecast array; context changes cannot reuse a forecast. Writes are atomic, malformed entries miss, and serving remains uncached unless explicitly opted in. Generated forecast files stay untracked.\n\nBefore enabling this cache for scored experiments, queue an exact uncached-versus-disk-reloaded forecast parity check behind the current GPU queue. Then enable it only on subsequent registered interaction runs, preserving oneGPU scheduling. This changes computation reuse, not the model, prompt paths, training or scorer. Final serving latency must still be measured without the research cache.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/chronos_vol.py');s=p.read_text().replace('import os,random','import os,random,hashlib,json')\nneedle=\\\"def predict_hourly(asset,origin,seed,values,model_name='chronos-t5-tiny'):\\\\n    import torch\\\"\nrepl=\\\"\\\"\\\"def predict_hourly(asset,origin,seed,values,model_name='chronos-t5-tiny'):\n    cache_file=None\n    cache_root=os.environ.get('CHRONOS_RESEARCH_CACHE')\n    if cache_root:\n        provenance=(Path(__file__).parent/'models'/model_name/'provenance.json').read_bytes()\n        key=hashlib.sha256(Path(__file__).read_bytes()+provenance+json.dumps([asset,origin,seed,model_name]).encode()+np.asarray(values,dtype=np.float64).tobytes()).hexdigest()\n        cache_file=Path(cache_root)/key[:2]/(key+'.npy')\n        try:\n            saved=np.load(cache_file,allow_pickle=False)\n            if saved.shape==(25,) and np.all(np.isfinite(saved)) and np.all(saved>0):return saved\n        except (OSError,ValueError):pass\n    import torch\\\"\\\"\\\"\nassert needle in s;s=s.replace(needle,repl)\nold=\\\"    return np.mean(np.exp(np.clip(pred,-3,3)),axis=0)*center\\\"\nnew=\\\"\\\"\\\"    result=np.mean(np.exp(np.clip(pred,-3,3)),axis=0)*center\n    if cache_file is not None:\n        cache_file.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n        temporary=cache_file.with_suffix('.'+str(os.getpid())+'.tmp')\n        with temporary.open('wb') as stream:np.save(stream,result,allow_pickle=False)\n        temporary.replace(cache_file)\n    return result\\\"\\\"\\\"\nassert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('agent/run_suite.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();\\\",\\\"p=argparse.ArgumentParser();p.add_argument('--forecast-cache');\\\",1)\nneedle=\\\" with prefix.with_suffix('.log').open('w') as f:r=subprocess.run(cmd,stdout=f,stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,env=env)\\\"\ns=s.replace(needle,\\\" if a.forecast_cache:env['CHRONOS_RESEARCH_CACHE']=a.forecast_cache\\\\n\\\"+needle);p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > agent/verify_forecast_cache.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Exact opt-in disk-cache parity; run as the sole GPU process.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport os,json,tempfile\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.config import default_store_root\nfrom predict import load_minute_prices,context_end\nimport chronos_vol\nseed=int(os.environ.get('SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED','20261011'))\nt=pd.Timestamp('2026-09-16T12:17:00Z')\nframe=load_minute_prices(default_store_root('BTC').parents[2],'BTC',t-pd.Timedelta(days=8),t)\nend=context_end(t,3600);frame=frame.loc[(frame.index>end-pd.Timedelta(days=7))&(frame.index<=end)]\nfuture=pd.date_range(t+pd.Timedelta(minutes=1),periods=60,freq='min')\nos.environ.pop('CHRONOS_RESEARCH_CACHE',None)\na=chronos_vol.forecast_variance(frame,'BTC',future,seed)\nwith tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(dir='agent/results') as root:\n os.environ['CHRONOS_RESEARCH_CACHE']=root\n chronos_vol.predict_hourly.cache_clear()\n b=chronos_vol.forecast_variance(frame,'BTC',future,seed)\n assert np.array_equal(a,b)\n files=list(Path(root).rglob('*.npy'));assert len(files)==1\n chronos_vol.predict_hourly.cache_clear()\n original=chronos_vol.pipeline\n def forbidden(*args,**kwargs):raise AssertionError('Disk cache unexpectedly ran inference')\n chronos_vol.pipeline=forbidden\n c=chronos_vol.forecast_variance(frame,'BTC',future,seed)\n assert np.array_equal(a,c)\n chronos_vol.pipeline=original\nos.environ.pop('CHRONOS_RESEARCH_CACHE',None)\nprint(json.dumps({'exact_uncached_disk_parity':True,'cache_reload_without_inference':True,'forecast_points':len(a)}))\nPY\ncat >> .gitignore <<'EOF'\n# Research-only forecasts, reproducible from committed weights and full keyed inputs.\nagent/results/chronos_forecast_cache/\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('agent/queue_chronos_interactions.json');jobs=json.loads(p.read_text())\nfor job in jobs:job['cmd']+=['--forecast-cache','agent/results/chronos_forecast_cache']\njobs.insert(0,{'cmd':['uv','run','--group','research','agent/verify_forecast_cache.py'],'log':'agent/results/forecast_cache_parity.log'})\np.write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
