{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_358","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Iteration51 — matched constant-mixture control\n\nHypothesis: adaptive-mixture gains reflect state dependence rather than merely a higher average log-volatility variance. Compute its mean squared mixture width from prevalidation June08–August31 contexts at six-hour intervals, pooled equally over the five crypto assets. Use the square root of that training-only mean as a single constant-mixture control. This parameter is determined without official validation outcomes; no grid or per-asset choice is permitted.\n\nCompare the resulting constant with both v7 fixed0.35 and the adaptive model on both full windows,1000 paths,float32. Retain a claim of adaptive benefit only if it beats the matched control on both means and most cells. Record the training width distribution. Fit and score with two CPU workers after the forecast-decay queue PID56474; noGPU and unchanged total allocation.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text();needle=\\\"    future=pd.date_range(pd.Timestamp(start_time)+pd.Timedelta(seconds=time_increment),periods=steps,freq=pd.Timedelta(seconds=time_increment))\\\";assert needle in s;s=s.replace(needle,\\\"    if c.get('_variance_diagnostics') is not None:\\\\n        c['_variance_diagnostics'].update(initial=float(initial),long=float(long))\\\\n\\\"+needle);p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > agent/fit_matched_mix.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Training-only constant control matched to adaptive log-volatility variance.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport os,json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom predict import load_minute_prices,context_end\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.config import default_store_root\nfrom research_model import simulate_config\nseed=int(os.environ.get('SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED','20261011'))\nrows=[]\nstarts=pd.date_range('2026-06-08','2026-09-01',freq='6h',inclusive='left',tz='UTC')\nfor asset in ['BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE']:\n frame=load_minute_prices(default_store_root(asset).parents[2],asset,starts[0]-pd.Timedelta(days=8),starts[-1])\n for t in starts:\n  end=context_end(t,3600);context=frame.loc[(frame.index>end-pd.Timedelta(days=7))&(frame.index<=end)]\n  state={};cfg={'seasonal':True,'clock':True,'fast_half':15,'_seed':seed,'_variance_diagnostics':state}\n  simulate_config(asset,t,60,3600,1,context,np.random.default_rng(seed),cfg)\n  ratio=state['initial']/state['long'];width=min(.55,float(np.sqrt(.35**2+.10*np.log(ratio)**2)))\n  rows.append(dict(asset=asset,start_time=str(t),ratio=ratio,mix=width))\n df=pd.DataFrame([r for r in rows if r['asset']==asset]);print(asset,df['mix'].describe().to_dict(),flush=True)\ndf=pd.DataFrame(rows);matched=float(np.sqrt(df['mix'].pow(2).mean()))\nPath('agent/matched_mix.json').write_text(json.dumps({'train_start':'2026-06-08','train_end_exclusive':'2026-09-01','contexts':len(df),'constant_mix':matched},indent=2))\ndf.to_csv('agent/results/matched_mix_training.csv',index=False)\nprint('Matched constant mixture',matched,flush=True)\njob={'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag','matched_mix_v7_full','--model','candidate_v8_research','--config',json.dumps({'mix':matched}),'--cached-prompts','--prediction-dtype','float32','--days','10','--ends','2026-09-19','2026-10-11','--assets','BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','--formats','1h','--workers','2'],'log':'agent/results/matched_mix_v7_full_suite.log'}\nPath('agent/queue_matched_mix_score.json').write_text(json.dumps([job],indent=2))\nPY\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\njobs=[{'cmd':['uv','run','agent/fit_matched_mix.py'],'log':'agent/results/matched_mix_fit.log'},{'cmd':['uv','run','agent/queue_research.py','--jobs','agent/queue_matched_mix_score.json'],'log':'agent/results/queue_matched_mix_score.log'}]\nPath('agent/queue_matched_mix.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2))\nPY\nuv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_matched_mix.json --after-pid 56474 > agent/results/queue_matched_mix.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
