ese studies queue sequentially after iteration52, retaining its four-worker allocation. Current learned GPU studies remain one-at-a-time.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"def clock_at(index,asset,lag):\\\\n    values=table('clock.json').get(asset)\\\",\\\"def clock_at(index,asset,lag,name='clock.json'):\\\\n    values=table(name).get(asset)\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"clock_at(idx,asset,lag)\\\",\\\"clock_at(idx,asset,lag,c.get('clock_table','clock.json'))\\\").replace(\\\"clock_at(future,asset,max(1,time_increment//60))\\\",\\\"clock_at(future,asset,max(1,time_increment//60),c.get('clock_table','clock.json'))\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('agent/fit_clock.py');s=p.read_text().replace('import json','import json,argparse');s=s.replace('out={}','p=argparse.ArgumentParser();p.add_argument(\\\\'--start\\\\',default=\\\\'2026-06-01\\\\');p.add_argument(\\\\'--end\\\\',default=\\\\'2026-09-01\\\\');p.add_argument(\\\\'--table\\\\',default=\\\\'seasonality.json\\\\');p.add_argument(\\\\'--output\\\\',default=\\\\'agent/clock.json\\\\');a=p.parse_args()\\\\nout={}')\ns=s.replace(\\\"'2026-06-01'<=f.stem[5:]<'2026-09-01'\\\",\\\"a.start<=f.stem[5:]<a.end\\\").replace('shape_at(r.index,asset,True)','shape_at(r.index,asset,True,a.table)').replace(\\\"Path('agent/clock.json')\\\",\\\"Path(a.output)\\\").replace(\\\"'train_end_exclusive':'2026-09-01'\\\",\\\"'train_start':a.start,'train_end_exclusive':a.end\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\njobs=[]\ndef suite(tag,cfg,days,ends):\n return {'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model','candidate_v8_research','--config',json.dumps(cfg),'--cached-prompts','--prediction-dtype','float32','--days',str(days),'--ends',*ends,'--assets','BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','--formats','1h','--workers','4'],'log':f'agent/results/{tag}_suite.log'}\nfor tag,cfg in [('bridge_v8_full',{'sampler':'sobol