{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_372","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration51 fitted control:1,700 training contexts yield constant log-volatility std0.3842461321. Contexts are spaced six hours at minute17, avoiding an exclusive round-hour diagnostic. Per-asset mean adaptive width ranges0.3731–0.3872. The control is fitted before scoring and is not selected from a width grid.\n\n## Iteration55 — adaptive center versus extra tail uncertainty\n\nHypothesis: adaptive mixture gains require preserving second-moment tail uncertainty, rather than only narrowing the central fan when fast/long variance disagree. Keep mixture0.35 and apply a conditional width multiplier exp(0.35\"'^2-adaptive_width''^2). This exactly matches the adaptive mixture'\"'s median path-volatility factor while reducing its unconditional variance; all parameters derive from the already-fixed adaptive formula. Compare this center-only control with adaptive mixture and v8 on both full windows,1000 paths,float32.\n\nRequire both means and most cells for any selection; report an adaptive advantage only if the tail-preserving form wins. No refitting or new shrinkage coefficient. Two CPU workers queue after the matched-control study PID58988, retaining the overall14-worker/oneGPU ceiling.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('agent/research_model.py');s=p.read_text();old=\\\"\\\"\\\"    if mix and c.get('adaptive_mix',False):\n        disagreement=np.log(max(initial,1e-14)/max(long,1e-14))\n        mix=min(.55,float(np.sqrt(mix*mix+.10*disagreement*disagreement)))\\\"\\\"\\\";new=\\\"\\\"\\\"    if mix and (c.get('adaptive_mix',False) or c.get('adaptive_center_only',False)):\n        if c.get('adaptive_mix',False) and c.get('adaptive_center_only',False):\n            raise ValueError('Adaptive mixture and center-only are separate experiments')\n        disagreement=np.log(max(initial,1e-14)/max(long,1e-14))\n        adaptive_width=min(.55,float(np.sqrt(mix*mix+.10*disagreement*disagreement)))\n        if c.get('adaptive_center_only',False):sig*=np.exp(mix*mix-adaptive_width*adaptive_width)\n        else:mix=adaptive_width\\\"\\\"\\\";assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)\njob={'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag','adaptive_center_v8_full','--model','candidate_v8_research','--config',json.dumps({'adaptive_center_only':True}),'--cached-prompts','--prediction-dtype','float32','--days','10','--ends','2026-09-19','2026-10-11','--assets','BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','--formats','1h','--workers','2'],'log':'agent/results/adaptive_center_v8_full_suite.log'}\nPath('agent/queue_adaptive_center.json').write_text(json.dumps([job],indent=2))\nPY\nuv run agent/queue_research.py --jobs agent/queue_adaptive_center.json --after-pid 58988 > agent/results/queue_adaptive_center.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
