{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_393","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat agent/BUDGET.md\ncat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration57 scope update BEFORE those cached tests run: symmetric adaptation has failed historical selection. Add Chronos+bridge WITHOUT adaptive as the primary current-serving comparison, on full and added periods. Preserve the already-registered symmetric combinations as research results, but do not promote them without resolving their historical failure. Cached forecasts are independent of these distribution choices.\n\n## Iteration60 — measure standardized return autocorrelation\n\nHypothesis: serial dependence in base-step returns changes the variance-growth curve across scored horizons, something a uniform width multiplier cannot fix. Measure non-overlapping adjacent standardized returns at1-minute lag for crypto1h and5-minute lag for all24h assets, using only June–August prices. Remove the appropriate coarse/fine seasonal profile and a strictly lagged slow volatility level; never interpolate NaN prices. Report early-training versus August correlations and a50%-shrunk/capped-at0.10 coefficient as a possible conservative model input.\n\nThese are diagnostics, not CRPS. Before adding correlated Gaussian increments, inspect sign stability and the implied long-horizon variance factor. No autoregressive mean forecast is implied: a covariance-law experiment would initially keep zero mean. Use one CPU worker within the currently freed slots; all serving choices remain unchanged.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('agent/queue_chronos_bridge.json');jobs=json.loads(p.read_text());extra=[]\nfor tag,days,ends in [('chronos_bridge_v9_full',10,['2026-09-19','2026-10-11']),('sep_late_chronos_bridge_v9',8,['2026-10-01'])]:\n extra.append({'cmd':['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model','candidate_v9_research','--config',json.dumps({'chronos':True}),'--research','--forecast-cache','agent/results/chronos_forecast_cache','--forecast-cache-only','--cached-prompts','--prediction-dtype','float32','--days',str(days),'--ends',*ends,'--assets','BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','--formats','1h','--workers','3'],'log':f'agent/results/{tag}_suite.log'})\np.write_text(json.dumps(extra+jobs,indent=2))\nPY\ncat > agent/diagnose_autocorrelation.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Prevalidation base-step return autocorrelation; no price interpolation or scores.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.config import default_store_root\nfrom research_model import shape_at,clock_at\ncrypto=['BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE'];assets=crypto+['XAU','NVDAX','GOOGLX','TSLAX','AAPLX','WTIOIL','SPCX','SP500']\nrows=[];out={}\nfor asset in assets:\n fs=[f for f in sorted(default_store_root(asset).glob('date=*.parquet')) if '2026-06-01'<=f.stem[5:]<'2026-09-01']\n frame=pd.concat([pd.read_parquet(f,columns=['timestamp','close']) for f in fs]).set_index('timestamp').sort_index()\n out[asset]={}\n for lag in ([1,5] if asset in crypto else [5]):\n  shape=shape_at(frame.index,asset,True,'seasonality.json' if asset in crypto else 'seasonality_fine.json')\n  if asset in crypto:shape*=clock_at(frame.index,asset,lag)\n  r=np.log(frame.close.astype(float)).diff(lag)\n  rv=r.pow(2)/lag/shape\n  level=rv.ewm(halflife=4320,min_periods=1440).mean().shift(lag)\n  z=(r/np.sqrt(lag*shape*level)).clip(-8,8)\n  pairs=pd.DataFrame({'current':z,'previous':z.shift(lag)}).loc['2026-06-08':].dropna()\n  def correlation(d):return float(d.current.corr(d.previous))\n  early=correlation(pairs.loc[:'2026-07-31']);late=correlation(pairs.loc['2026-08-01':]);raw=correlation(pairs);rho=float(np.clip(.5*raw,-.1,.1))\n  out[asset][str(lag)]=rho\n  rows.append(dict(asset=asset,lag=lag,pairs=len(pairs),early_rho=early,august_rho=late,raw_rho=raw,shrunk_rho=rho,long_std_factor=float(np.sqrt((1+rho)/(1-rho)))))\n  print(rows[-1],flush=True)\nPath('agent/autocorrelation.json').write_text(json.dumps({'train_start':'2026-06-08','train_end_exclusive':'2026-09-01','assets':out},indent=2))\npd.DataFrame(rows).to_csv('agent/results/autocorrelation_diagnostics.csv',index=False)\nPY\nOPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/diagnose_autocorrelation.py > agent/results/autocorrelation_diagnostics.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
